            "type": "text",
            "text": "This "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "+2 greater striking cunning wounding sawtooth",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " saber appears rusty but never loses its edge. It's drawn to the blood of your targets. You gain a +2 item bonus to Seek or Track creatures that have blood."
