    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The serrated blade and chain of this "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "+2 greater striking keen wounding kusarigama",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " shine blood red. A crimson haze wafts from the blade."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Ensnaring Disarm",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "reaction"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Trigger",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " An enemy within reach misses you with a melee weapon Strike"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You attempt to Disarm the triggering creature. You can do so even if you don't have a hand free."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Bloodmist Whirl",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (concentrate, manipulate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per hour"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You whirl the chain of the sawtooth reaper, creating a crimson fog that conceals you for 1 round or until you Strike. The next Strike you make treats the target as "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "071324e5-bb4c-5ed2-9e2f-28185b65ded7"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", and when you use Ensnaring Disarm you can also Strike the same target as a free action."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
